{"title":"Ultimate Frisbee Pickup Game! (Weekly)","startsAt":"2026-10-09T12:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-09T14:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"REBOOT - Exercise! Fun! Food! Drinks! This meetup has it all!\n\nThis ultimate frisbee meetup is a great way to make friends and get great exercise at the same time! What is ultimate frisbee? It's like soccer with a frisbee but with end zones like football. Come out and learn the ropes and have a good time. All skill levels welcome.\n\nAnd after frisbee is food and drinks! This meetup runs every week from May through September.\n\nThis event is co-hosted with the group 30SomethingsinToronto.\nhttps://www.meetup.com/30SomethingsinTO/events/\n\nA 1 time per season charge of $2 is collected for equipment costs (Cones & Pinneys).\n\nSchedule:\n6:30-7:15 Practice\n7:15-8:30 Games\n9:00 Food and Drinks at a nearby pub! (TBD)","venue":{"name":"David A. Balfour Park","address":"75 Rosehill Ave, Toronto","lat":43.686462,"lng":-79.3887,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"30's Midtown Singles","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/e/4/7/highres_471324135.jpeg"}